title: ChaiReceipt_Start
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action approach_chai_tapri>>
ravi-anna: Aiyo, regular customer! Ek cutting?
<<wait_for_action order_chai>>
ravi-anna: ₹10. Same as yesterday. Same as kal also probably.
ravi-anna: Beta, ek favour. Take this notebook.
<<wait_for_action receive_notebook>>
ravi-anna: For seven days. Every chai you drink — anywhere, not just here —
ravi-anna: write the cost. End of week, we'll see something.
<<player_choose>>
-> "Sure, anna. Seven days."
    <<set_flag accepted_chai_log>>
    <<jump ChaiReceipt_Logging>>
-> "Why? It's only ten rupees."
    ravi-anna: Haan. ₹10. That is exactly why.
    ravi-anna: Big numbers we notice. Small numbers — they hide.
    <<set_flag accepted_chai_log>>
    <<jump ChaiReceipt_Logging>>
