title: ChaiReceipt_Reveal
tags:
---
ravi-anna: Now multiply by 52 weeks. Phone se kar.
<<wait_for_action multiply 80 52>>
ravi-anna: ₹4,160. In one year. Just on chai from one stall.
ravi-anna: Average banda spends ₹70 a day on small things. Chai. Gutka.
ravi-anna: ₹70 times 365. Almost ₹25,550 a year. Gone. Sip by sip.
<<player_choose>>
-> "I should stop drinking chai."
    ravi-anna: Arre nahi! Don't stop. I'll be sad.
    ravi-anna: Just know the number. Knowing is the whole game.
    <<set_flag chai_awareness>>
-> "₹4,160 isn't that bad."
    ravi-anna: Maybe not. But now you can decide.
    ravi-anna: Before — it was a habit. Now — it is a choice.
    <<set_flag chai_awareness>>
-> "What if I drank one a day instead of two on some days?"
    ravi-anna: Smart question. Cut one chai a week — ₹520 a year.
    ravi-anna: Put that in the Save envelope. Same chai, plus a budget.
    <<set_flag chai_optimised>>
<<continue>>
maya-didi: Small leaks sink ships. Big leaks are easy to see.
maya-didi: The dangerous ones are the ones you don't count.
<<grant_mastery budgeting.small-leaks 1>>
<<set_flag finished_chai_receipt>>
ravi-anna: Notebook keep karo. Use it for sabzi, rickshaw, sab kuch.
===
